   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "MOVEMENT WITH LINES\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Size of gesture\n   2 Stillness\n   3 Blink\n   4 Anticipation\n   5 Leads the move\n   6 Facial expression\n   7 Eye darts\n   8 Posture\n   9 Touch\n  10 Walk and talk\n  11 Business with a prop\n  12 Move on the line\n  13 The listener's body\n  14 suite: The walk and talk\n  15 suite: Busy hands\n  16 suite: The task falls apart\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 2, CC 65 to 73\n   1 suite: Freeze on the line\n   2 suite: The real reaction\n   3 pair: When a big line lands, the body freezes\n   4 pair: When the speaker gets closer to the truth, the listener leans in\n   5 pair: When the anger rises, the task gets rougher\n   6 pair: When the task falls apart, a laugh comes\n   7 pair: When they walk and talk, the shots get longer\n   8 pairs: The body tells the line\n   9 pairs: Comic business"
   },
